  "id": "gem-15-catalog",
  "title": "GEM-15: Google Elevation Models at 15 m",
  "description": "Cloud-native mirror catalog for GEM-15, Google Research's experimental near-global surface (DSM) and bare-earth (DTM) elevation models at 15 m, derived from sub-meter optical stereo imagery. The 26,970 Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs stay at Google's public bucket; this catalog adds Portolan metadata, documentation, a global overview, and a terrarium-encoded terrain layer for MapLibre.",
